# Prevent core.autocrlf (or any other line-ending normalization) from ever
# touching binary assets. PNG/JPG/ICO can contain byte sequences that look
# like CRLF/LF to a naive text filter; "-text" tells git these are never
# text, so no conversion is applied on checkout or commit regardless of a
# user's local core.autocrlf setting.
*.png -text
*.jpg -text
*.jpeg -text
*.ico -text
